%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/io_test.clj:42 (writeXml-encoding-test)
testing: XML encoding in declaration
元の形: io/writeXml の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
write({"root": {"child": "value"}}, "application/xml", {"writeDeclaration": true, "encoding": "Shift_JIS"})
%%% output application/json
"<?xml version='1.0' encoding='Shift_JIS'?>\n<root>\n  <child>value</child>\n</root>"
